# Upstream-pending CVEs in Debian 12.13 base image
# (used by distroless nodejs22-debian12 + bookworm-slim runtime images).
#
# Per docs/runbooks/security-dry-run-v1.md §2: these CVEs have no patch
# available in the current Debian 12.13 security feed. Debian Security
# Tracker shows them as "pending upstream / next point release". They
# cannot be remediated by Furan-side changes — only by rebuilding on
# Debian 12.14 once it ships.
#
# Re-evaluate when Debian 12.14 lands and remove the corresponding entries
# from this file. Re-run `trivy image --severity CRITICAL,HIGH` to confirm
# closure before deleting an entry.
#
# Owner: @qasecret-maintainer
# Last reviewed: 2026-05-17 (Phase 5 D8 — security bump PR)

# libssl3 (OpenSSL) — Debian 12.13, fix pending in 12.14
